    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://infohub.siemens-energy.com/identifiers#hasTypeCode">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://schema.org/identifier"/>
        <rdfs:comment>The Typecode is a unique identifier for a particular design and valid for all plant project&apos;s. The typecode is referenced in the design. In most cases the items referencing typecodes are bulk items that don&apos;t have a Tag (e.g. KKS). The bulk item is part of an item having a Tag (e.g. KKS) but there can be several items part of a particular Tag having the same typecode (specification). The particular item cannot be tracked among data sources and can have different names.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>has typecode</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


